      "impact": "none",
      "plain": "The off-grid spacing steps 6px and 10px (--primitive-space-px6/px10, hds.space.px6/px10, Tailwind *-px6/*-px10) are deprecated and leave in 0.30.0; the codemod rewrites them to the 8px and 12px steps.",
